    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many people have been invited to celebrate the Penguin Hotel's 18th anniversary. You are one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one could have predicted it. No one expected it to turn out that way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freeze Camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This camera is a wonder. It can trap the subject inside the picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this camera to solve mysteries and fight threats. Of course, you can also use it normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Pen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the characters in this hotel. He is a robot, so he doesn't move at night...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a fan of horror?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to enjoy the world and the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We try to create games that both those who are good at horror games and those who are not good at horror games can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no ending branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Chapter 1. Chapter 2 will be available in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About video production and distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the name of this game in the distribution and video title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please put a link to SETAM in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the above, we do not specify anything else. Please use common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want many people to know this game. So videos and distribution are welcome.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many people have been invited to celebrate the Penguin Hotel's 18th anniversary. You are one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one could have predicted it. No one expected it to turn out that way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freeze Camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This camera is a wonder. It can trap the subject inside the picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this camera to solve mysteries and fight threats. Of course, you can also use it normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Pen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the characters in this hotel. He is a robot, so he doesn't move at night...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a fan of horror?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to enjoy the world and the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We try to create games that both those who are good at horror games and those who are not good at horror games can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no ending branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Chapter 1. Chapter 2 will be available in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About video production and distribution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the name of this game in the distribution and video title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please put a link to SETAM in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the above, we do not specify anything else. Please use common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want many people to know this game. So videos and distribution are welcome.</p>",
